editor_description = "Ralph the chandler, who makes the abbey's candles: short and heavy, grey, going bald. A brown tunic under a bibbed apron stained with wax, a coif, a bundle of tapers in his hand (tools/build/chr_ralph.py). Model is his body on its skeleton, with his clips (PersonModel). Feet at the origin, facing -Z. Head is his face (a FaceRig over the head model); Face is where the conversation camera looks. In the game both ride on the skeleton's head."
